        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Northeast Florida Regional Airport, Glacier Park International Airport, St. Augustine, St. Johns County, Florida, Flathead County, Montana, Kalispell\n- Codes: UST, KSGJ, SGJ, FCA, KGPI, GPI\n\nFacts:\n- Northeast Florida Regional Airport was formerly named St. Augustine Airport.\n- Northeast Florida Regional Airport uses IATA code UST, ICAO code KSGJ, and FAA LID SGJ.\n- Northeast Florida Regional Airport is four miles north of St. Augustine in St. Johns County, Florida.\n- Glacier Park International Airport uses IATA code FCA, ICAO code KGPI, and FAA LID GPI.\n- Glacier Park International Airport is in Flathead County, Montana, six miles northeast of Kalispell.",
